$bbbPlankBeamGroupLoop = $explicitSelectorFamilies -match ('for \(String material : List\.of\(' + $bbbBeamMaterialListPattern + '\)\)\s*\{\s*result\.add\(ids\("minecraft:" \+ material \+ "_planks",\s*"bbb:" \+ material \+ "_beam"\)\);\s*\}')
